  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2200 VOLUNTARY CERTIFIED SALT APPLICATOR PROGRAM",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Wq 2200 VOLUNTARY CERTIFIED SALT APPLICATOR PROGRAM\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 489-C:3\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #13982, effective 5-24-24, adopted, repealed, readopted, and readopted with amendment all of Chapter Env-Wq 2200. Document #13982 adopted new definitions Env-Wq 2202.06 (“Employee or official of a governmental unit”), Env-Wq 2202.07 (“Governmental unit”), Env-Wq 2022.08 (“Geen SnowPro Coordinator”), Env-Wq 2202.11 (“Municipal winter maintenance certification program”), and repealed definition Env-Wq 2202.09 (“Salt accounting system”). Document #14019 also repealed Env-Wq 2203.07 (Late Filing of Renewal Applications) and adopted new Env-Wq 2207 (Requirements for Certified Municipal Winter Maintenance Programs)\n\nDocument #13982 renumbered some rules within Chapter Env-Wq 2200, as follows:\n\nFormer Rule New Rule",
